    {
      "id": "du-xiao-liang-accession-office",
      "title": "梁初授中书舍人，另存工部侍郎记载",
      "summary": "梁太祖受禅后，杜晓获授中书舍人，仍兼此前职事；新史另记太祖即位后迁工部侍郎，官职叙次分别保留。",
      "year": 907,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "year",
      "sourceDate": "太祖受禅／即位后；任官未独记月日",
      "phase": "service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v018",
          "paragraphId": "old-v018-p10",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "7dda01670007698df3a0d4f3aea8f476c442938fdac320e5ce0e1af429891b76",
          "excerpt": "太祖受禪，拜中書舍人，職如故。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v266",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v266-p3",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "cad14bb13f5ee8ac13e30e9dd5f34f95368692986ea50c22bfde3d74393b05b2",
          "excerpt": "太祖神武元聖孝皇帝上開平元年（丁卯，公元九零七年）"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v266",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v266-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "6dfcb1993682473797d402001c676607240ce5e39be8302a81f08a8843ed3ddf",
          "excerpt": "王被兗冕，即皇帝位。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "受禅之年据编年记载定位；本传没有单独记任官月日，不能把即位甲子作为杜晓受职日。"
      ],
      "variants": [
