          "originalSha256": "7dda01670007698df3a0d4f3aea8f476c442938fdac320e5ce0e1af429891b76",
          "excerpt": "憂滿，服幅巾七升，沈跡自廢者將十餘載。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v35",
          "paragraphId": "new-v35-p25",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "80022dd07c4f24dd33f05a282109abdb3e5407919c7ff8fb0e14acf7169131d0",
